Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: hako-mesa
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libegl1, libglvnd0, libvulkan1
Description: Mesa with Adreno 613 support, for the hako session only
 Mesa built from Debian's mesa source (newer than trixie's) with only the
 freedreno drivers: OpenGL / GLES / EGL / GBM (gallium) and Vulkan (turnip).
 Debian trixie's Mesa 25.0 (and 26.1 in backports) does not know the
 Adreno 613 of the SM4450 (Anbernic RG 55G1); it was added in Mesa 26.2.
 .
 Installed in /usr/lib/hako/mesa, next to Debian's Mesa, which it does not
 replace. A board selects it for the game session (LD_LIBRARY_PATH, the glvnd
 EGL vendor file and the Vulkan ICD file; see /usr/lib/hako/mesa/env.sh).
 Drop it once Debian's Mesa is new enough.
